# "Fast" tier (docs/15 D-1) — Planner, Query Decomposer, Evidence Extractor.
# These nodes do bounded transformation/extraction, not open synthesis, so a
# smaller model trades some quality for throughput deliberately.
#
# TODO (D-30, pre-V1): replace the tag below with a digest-pinned reference
# once the hardware benchmark picks the exact parameter size. See README.md.
FROM qwen3:8b

PARAMETER temperature 0.1
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
